really enjoyed reading them! But honestly my favorites were the Gay Bee Dads.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4500-kuiperbelt","name":"KuiperBelt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4500_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T15:38:11-07:00","id":1302664,"title":"","content":"Have you made any changes to your Sorcerers supplement? I remember it as something excellent, especially the spells.<br /> <br /> As for the new elementals, I liked them a lot, I'm going to give them a lot of use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25189-dagurasu","name":"Dagurasu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T15:53:01-07:00","id":1302670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dagurasu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1302570-the-thousand-sanctioned-beasts-elementals-redux?p=1302664#post1302664\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you made any changes to your Sorcerers supplement? I remember it as something excellent, especially the spells.</div> </div> </div> </div>I haven't, although I'll probably go back to it once I've finished with elementals before going 